From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Rowley <johnrowleyster@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:59:58 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Declare IDirectDraw4 and IDirectDrawSurface4 in miniwin

Add the DirectX 6 DirectDraw interfaces with their DDSURFACEDESC2 and
DDSCAPS2 structs and IIDs. IDirectDraw4 extends IDirectDraw2 and
IDirectDrawSurface4 extends IDirectDrawSurface3, redeclaring the methods
whose DirectX 6 signatures take the version-4 types, so callers holding
an IDirectDraw4 or IDirectDrawSurface4 see the DirectX 6 signatures.

DirectDrawImpl now answers QueryInterface for IID_IDirectDraw and
IID_IDirectDraw4, and the surface classes for IID_IDirectDrawSurface,
IID_IDirectDrawSurface3 and IID_IDirectDrawSurface4. The new methods are
stubs that log once and return DDERR_UNSUPPORTED.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/miniwin/include/miniwin/ddraw.h b/miniwin/include/miniwin/ddraw.h
index 912a1b9..d7385f9 100644
